49f7f20c00dd154384418078f8a09e79c400a06a.

The original BSD-3-Clause copyright and license remain in LICENSE and in
development/AMDRadeonRDNA4-Navi44/LICENSE. M6 through M8 local modifications
are identified in reports/changed-files.json, reports/m65/changed-files.json,
reports/m7/changed-files.json, reports/m8/changed-files.json and patches/.
