Project additions follow the existing BSD-3-Clause licensing policy.

Exceptions must keep their original terms:
- upstream/references/llvm-ELF.h: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception;
  see licenses/LLVM-LICENSE.txt and the source header.
- upstream/references/linux-discovery.h: AMD MIT notice in the source header.
- development/AMDRadeonRDNA4-Navi44/src/amdgpu/clearstate*.h:
  AMD MIT notices remain in each source header.
- development/AMDRadeonRDNA4-Navi44/vulkan/mesa-patches/: Mesa MIT terms;
  see the adjacent README.txt and LICENSE-Navi48-* notices.
- Imported generated shader source arrays are upstream source references,
  not validated Navi44 executables, firmware, or M8 GPU test results.

The original author's public copyright contact is retained as attribution.
No Apple proprietary SDK, GPU firmware payload or VBIOS ROM is distributed.
Upstream emulator sources and hardware capture logs are omitted.
Full third-party reference clones are omitted; fixed sources and licenses
are listed in UPSTREAM_SOURCES.md. No claim is made that every upstream
project uses the root license.
